{360}{I think this is Black Root.  Small fishing village and port.  There was a war here, many years ago...King Praetor of Cumbria attacked the city and set it to burn.  It's taken many years, but it seems the place has recovered quite well...}{I think this is Black Root.  Small fishing village and port.  There was a war here, many years ago...King Praetor of Cumbria attacked the city and set it to burn.  It's taken many years, but it seems the place has recovered quite well...}{}{45}{}{}
