{364}{This is Dernholm, capital city of the kingdom of Cumbria.  King Praetor has ruled here for more than 50 years, but it seems that Cumbria's power has crumbled over the years.  The kingdom suffered a crushing defeat in a war with Tarant, and Praetor's father was killed in the conflict.  The kingdom was never the same again...}{This is Dernholm, capital city of the kingdom of Cumbria.  King Praetor has ruled here for more than 50 years, but it seems that Cumbria's power has crumbled over the years.  The kingdom suffered a crushing defeat in a war with Tarant, and Praetor's father was killed in the conflict.  The kingdom was never the same again...}{}{46}{}{}
