{368}{Ashbury?  Oh, not much I'm afraid.  I know it's a major port, and that there's an old castle around here somewhere...a relic from the old monarchy.  You see, Ashbury is a part of the Unified Kingdom, along with Tarant.  [He chuckles.]  Well, perhaps I knew a little more than I first thought...}{Ashbury?  Oh, not much I'm afraid.  I know it's a major port, and that there's an old castle around here somewhere...a relic from the old monarchy.  You see, Ashbury is a part of the Unified Kingdom, along with Tarant.  [He chuckles.]  Well, perhaps I knew a little more than I first thought...}{}{47}{}{}
