{372}{I believe this is Stillwater...a small mining town.  Its real claim to fame is a legendary beast called the Stillwater Giant.  It's typical rural mythology...babies being kidnapped and eaten, that sort of thing...probably a bunch of rubbish.  [He looks around.]  Then again, you never know what's roaming around in these old mountains...}{I believe this is Stillwater...a small mining town.  Its real claim to fame is a legendary beast called the Stillwater Giant.  It's typical rural mythology...babies being kidnapped and eaten, that sort of thing...probably a bunch of rubbish.  [He looks around.]  Then again, you never know what's roaming around in these old mountains...}{}{48}{}{}
