{376}{Why, this is Tulla!  My home for the last 20 years!  There's not a more interesting place in all of Arcanum!  The Master Mage here is a man named Simeon Tor...a hard man, but fair...probably the most powerful mage in the whole world!  And of course there's Pelojian's Pool, and the mansions of the great mages, and...oh, sorry about that!  I do get carried away sometimes...}{Why, this is Tulla!  My home for the last 20 years!  There's not a more interesting place in all of Arcanum!  The Master Mage here is a man named Simeon Tor...a hard man, but fair...probably the most powerful mage in the whole world!  And of course there's Pelojian's Pool, and the mansions of the great mages, and...oh, sorry about that!  I do get carried away sometimes...}{}{49}{}{}
